|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I = ideal(u^3, x*y^2, (x+y)*z^2, x^2*u+z*u^2, y^2*u+x*z*u, y^2*z+y*z^2) |
|                                                                             |
|             3     2     2      2   2       2   2            2       2       |
|o3 = ideal (u , x*y , x*z  + y*z , x u + z*u , y u + x*z*u, y z + y*z )      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of S                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : J = trim (I + (ideal vars S)^6)                                         |
|                                                                             |
|             3   2            2       2     2      2   2       2     2   5   |
|o4 = ideal (u , y u + x*z*u, x u + z*u , x*z  + y*z , y z + y*z , x*y , z u, |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      6   4      5    6   5    6                                             |
|     z , x y*z, x z, y , x y, x )                                            |
|                                                                             |
